# Code owners — L2 paths only (merge levels: CONTRIBUTING.md#merge-levels).
#
# A PR that touches one of these paths needs a maintainer's review before it
# merges. Everything else merges on the full gate plus review (L0/L1), so there
# is deliberately no `*` default owner. Path rules are a first cut: a reviewer
# can always raise a PR's level, never lower it.

